    "description": "A painterly World War II portrait of a British soldier on the march, his Brodie helmet low and his rifle slung across his back, webbing pouches at his chest, caught mid-stride on a dusty road with another man behind him. Dust hangs in the air and his gaze stays forward, fixed on the road ahead. Part of Wayne Heim's *Facing History* fine art photography series. © Wayne Heim",
