    "title": "Rescue Mission",
    "description": "A painterly World War II portrait of a British Army medic hurrying across an open field, her Brodie helmet low and her red cross armband bright against her battledress, a medical bag slung over her shoulder. She leans into the run, eyes fixed on the place where someone has gone down. Part of Wayne Heim's *Facing History* fine art photography series. © Wayne Heim",
    "alt": "Painterly World War II portrait of a British Army medic with a red cross armband and Brodie helmet running across a field carrying a medical bag.",
    "buyLink": "https://wayne-heim.smugmug.com/Galleries/Painterly-Fine-Art-Photography/Facing-History/WWII/Portraits/Color/i-tNfpL4T/A",

