    "title": "Helmet in Hand",
    "description": "A painterly World War II portrait of a soldier standing alone in a bare, dusty field, his steel helmet held in one hand and his rifle standing muzzle-down at his side, a satchel across his chest and his pack on his back. The pale sky and cracked earth stretch empty around him — a portrait of the infantryman between orders, holding his ground. Part of Wayne Heim's *Facing History* fine art photography series. © Wayne Heim",
    "alt": "Painterly World War II portrait of a soldier standing alone in a dusty field holding his steel helmet in one hand with a rifle at his side.",
    "buyLink": "https://wayne-heim.smugmug.com/Galleries/Painterly-Fine-Art-Photography/Facing-History/WWII/Portraits/Color/i-T8K9XHN/A",

