    "description": "A painterly World War II portrait of an American sergeant in his M1 steel helmet, his M1 Garand rifle carried across his chest at port arms and his pack on his back, marching in profile against a wash of the American flag. Other soldiers move behind him — a portrait of the sergeant leading from the front. Part of Wayne Heim's *Facing History* fine art photography series. © Wayne Heim",
