    "description": "A painterly World War II portrait of a nurse in her white cap with the red cross emblem, a stethoscope around her neck, her head bowed over the work in her hands. She wears a striped dress with a white apron — a portrait of the woman who listens for the heart, and hears what the rest of the ward cannot. Part of Wayne Heim's *Facing History* fine art photography series. © Wayne Heim",
