    "description": "A painterly World War II portrait of six servicewomen standing in a line on a sandy beach, the sea gray behind them and the wind in their uniforms. They wear service dress with skirts and garrison caps, shoulder to shoulder, some smiling at the camera — a portrait of the women of the war, off duty for a moment, together. Part of Wayne Heim's *Facing History* fine art photography series. © Wayne Heim",
