    "title": "Taking His Pressure",
    "description": "A painterly World War II portrait of a Red Cross nurse taking a wounded German soldier's blood pressure, the cuff around his arm and the gauge in her hand, her stethoscope at her ears. He sits still while she works, his gaze on the gauge — a portrait of the quiet medical work that happens behind the fighting. Part of Wayne Heim's *Facing History* fine art photography series. © Wayne Heim",
    "alt": "Painterly World War II portrait of a nurse with a stethoscope taking a soldier's blood pressure with a cuff and gauge.",
    "buyLink": "https://wayne-heim.smugmug.com/Galleries/Painterly-Fine-Art-Photography/Facing-History/WWII/Portraits/Color/i-4cLQTsM/A",

