    "description": "A painterly World War II portrait of a group of German soldiers halted beside a wooden cart, one man grinning broadly at the camera in a field cap while his comrades in steel helmets look away, one helmet circled by a rust-red band, gray-green uniforms softened by painterly light. Painterly portrait photography gives the frame its warm, hand-finished depth, turning a candid roadside pause into a lasting image of the war's human side. Part of Wayne Heim's *Facing History* fine art photography series. © Wayne Heim",
